I   note memlock-limited: RLIMIT_MEMLOCK is 8.00 MiB and the n-gram table is read from the container on disk
I        why: a locked copy of the table in RAM is one of the faster tiers, and the memlock limit is one of the things that keeps --ngram-placement auto off it
